<title>USA: Washington Mutual expands loan commitment.</title>
<headline>Washington Mutual expands loan commitment.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerry Killinger, chairman, president and chief executive of Washington Mutual Inc, told a news conference Thursday a $75 billion 10-year community investment commitment includes new programs beyond what Washington Mutual and Great Western Financial Corp would have been targeting without their planned merger.</p>
<p>Washington Mutual and Great Western have signed a merger agrreement but H.F. Ahmanson and Co has continued to pursue Great Western with a rival bid.</p>
</text>
